  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Differentiating on both the sides and using Newton Leibnitz rule&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>U</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>V</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msubsup><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>It is a linear differential equation in the form of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
  }
